        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela uyookala mumonya mumunzi mane akaime kubusyu bwambungano kuti abetekwe, mane kusikila kulufu lwamupaizi mupati wakuciindi eco, elyo sikujaya nayoobweeda kumunzi wakwe akuŋanda yakwe, kumunzi oyo nkwaakazwa naakacija.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.6",
