        {
          "text": "Alimwi mutala lya-Jordano kujwe lya-Jeriko bakasala Bezeri munkanda yakumabanda, munzi wamukowa wa-Rubeni, aRamoti-Gileadi wamukowa wa-Gadi, a-Golani wamu-Basana wamukowa wa-Manase. ",
